    "ui_label must carry the mode's tag: Not available / Assisted only / Experimental / Autonomous.",
    "backend_check is what tests/e2e/platforms/test_p7_release_gates.py observes on the real backend; a non-autonomous feature whose backend dispatches on its own, or an autonomous one whose backend does not, fails the suite."
